WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:05.700
We took an in-depth look at the fitness regimens
employed by some of your favorite Marvel stars,

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:10.170
with an emphasis on the diets and workouts
they used leading up to the MCU's big showdown

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:11.170
against Thanos.

00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:12.190
Lupita Nyong'o went through bootcamp

00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:17.789
Lupita Nyong'o is a relative newcomer to the
MCU her first Marvel film was 2018's Black

00:00:17.789 --> 00:00:20.320
Panther and she put in a lot of work to get
in shape.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:28.310
"We had six weeks of bootcamp, where they
got us all buff and ready to go."

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:29.900
Fortunately, she enjoyed the physical challenge.

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:30.900
Nyong'o said:

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:33.390
"It's just gaining strength, stamina, and
flexibility…

00:00:33.390 --> 00:00:37.030
I had to get into particularly good shape
to be able to do the stunts."

00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:40.719
The bootcamp worked, and her physical skill
as Nakia is evident.

00:00:40.719 --> 00:00:44.690
It's easy to imagine that her workout routine
for Avengers: Endgame rests on continuing

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:46.260
to train hard and put on muscle.

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:47.260
Karen Gillan did martial arts

00:00:47.260 --> 00:00:51.780
Karen Gillan debuted as Nebula in the Guardians
of the Galaxy franchise before appearing in

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:55.850
Infinity War and Endgame, and she didn't skimp
as she prepared for the role.

00:00:55.850 --> 00:01:01.149
Squats, barbell deadlifts, and other weightlifting
moves played a big role in her workout routine;

00:01:01.149 --> 00:01:04.600
cardio like running and cycling upped her
endurance so she could last during the long

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:05.830
days on set.

00:01:05.830 --> 00:01:07.550
Next came martial arts training.

00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:08.550
As Gillan put it:

00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:11.620
"I had to start from the scratch in terms
of learning how to fight, to look like I could

00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:12.800
do damage to someone."

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.900
Finally, she also transformed her diet: eating
protein shakes, apples, and almond butter

00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:21.940
all helped Gillan get the protein she needed
in order to build more muscle and step into

00:01:21.940 --> 00:01:23.000
the role of Nebula.

00:01:28.640 --> 00:01:30.000
"It's not ripe."

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:31.720
Chris Pratt went for trail runs

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:34.770
Chris Pratt, better known as Star-Lord to
Marvel fans, took to Instagram to share his

00:01:34.770 --> 00:01:36.620
Avengers: Infinity War workout.

00:01:36.620 --> 00:01:40.810
In the videos on his Instagram stories, Pratt
took a three-mile trail run as a warm-up and

00:01:40.810 --> 00:01:44.410
then did three sets of 120-yard hill sprints.

00:01:44.410 --> 00:01:48.750
Pratt went through an intensive training regimen
for Guardians of the Galaxy, working for three

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:53.450
or four hours each day and losing 60 pounds
in just six months.

00:01:53.450 --> 00:01:58.380
During that time, Pratt also gave up alcohol,
ate 4,000 calories a day in a low-carb diet,

00:01:58.380 --> 00:02:04.011
and did swimming, boxing, P90X, running, kickboxing,
and even a triathlon as part of his workout

00:02:04.011 --> 00:02:05.011
routine.

00:02:05.011 --> 00:02:09.920
So when it came time to prepare for Infinity
War and Endgame, Pratt was prepared he knew

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:10.920
what it would take.

00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:13.480
And it seems like Pratt enjoys his workouts,
too.

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:15.909
"I can do 40-inch box jumps now.

00:02:15.909 --> 00:02:17.579
Action-hero physical stuff.

00:02:17.579 --> 00:02:19.650
Jumping that high feels really good.

00:02:19.650 --> 00:02:23.840
When you get in shape, the world around you
becomes things you want to jump on and climb

00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:24.840
on."

00:02:26.900 --> 00:02:28.160
“Oh my God are you Okay?

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:30.020
“Yeah, I’m good.”

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:33.120
Josh Brolin gave up carbs

00:02:33.129 --> 00:02:37.909
When Josh Brolin first started preparing to
play Cable in Deadpool 2, he went the low-carb

00:02:37.909 --> 00:02:39.069
route right away: No sugar.

00:02:39.069 --> 00:02:40.069
No bread.

00:02:40.069 --> 00:02:41.069
No pastas.

00:02:41.069 --> 00:02:45.489
It can be a difficult diet to follow, but
it's also one that can produce results that

00:02:45.489 --> 00:02:49.760
is much evident by watching Brolin as Thanos
in Avengers: Infinity War.

00:02:49.760 --> 00:02:53.599
In addition to exercising his self-control
in the kitchen, Brolin put in the work in

00:02:53.599 --> 00:02:57.459
the gym, too Gold's Gym, according to the
location on some of his Instagram workout

00:02:57.459 --> 00:02:58.459
videos.

00:02:58.459 --> 00:03:02.760
Brolin performed drop sets and other workout
moves with his trainer, Justin David Lovato

00:03:02.760 --> 00:03:04.650
of Built Nutrition and Training.

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:08.610
He's definitely put in the work, and although
he can now enjoy his role as Thanos, that

00:03:08.610 --> 00:03:10.579
role came at a heavy price.

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:12.500
"What did it cost?

00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:16.980
Everything."

00:03:16.980 --> 00:03:17.480
Robert Downey Jr. stayed loose

00:03:17.489 --> 00:03:19.980
Can you picture Iron Man doing yoga?

00:03:19.980 --> 00:03:24.469
That suit would definitely make it difficult,
but in real life, Robert Downey Jr. is an

00:03:24.469 --> 00:03:26.019
ardent enthusiast.

00:03:26.019 --> 00:03:30.129
In 2008, Downey described his infatuation
with yoga, telling TIME,

00:03:30.129 --> 00:03:32.150
"I need a lot of support…

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:33.219
Life is really hard.

00:03:33.219 --> 00:03:36.739
I've just been at the ready, and when the
opening was there, I hit it."

00:03:36.739 --> 00:03:40.771
Downey was in the news for an assortment of
dangerous behaviors many years ago, and he's

00:03:40.771 --> 00:03:44.700
said yoga is a big part of what helped him
improve his overall health and wellness and

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:46.129
stay on the straight and narrow.

00:03:46.129 --> 00:03:47.160
"It is Robert Downey Jr.

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:48.160
“Wow!"

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:49.420
"That's RDJ?"

00:03:49.720 --> 00:03:54.079
Yoga isn't a shocking or particularly exciting
workout; it doesn't make headlines like some

00:03:54.079 --> 00:03:57.200
of the other intense regimens other Marvel
actors put themselves through.

00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:59.510
But Downey doesn't stop there, either.

00:03:59.510 --> 00:04:08.010
"I train kung fu I strength train, I do chi-gong,
I do Susan Downey’s workout is Tracy Anderson."

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:10.010
Year-round fitness

00:04:10.010 --> 00:04:13.769
By now, we're pretty deep into the Marvel
universe more than 20 movies deep, in fact

00:04:13.769 --> 00:04:17.140
and many of Marvel's primary actors have been
around for a while.

00:04:17.140 --> 00:04:21.200
That's why they continue working out all year
long, even if they aren't training for any

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:22.410
specific film.

00:04:22.410 --> 00:04:26.570
Chris Hemsworth, in particular, maintains
a consistent workout routine to stay in shape

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:27.910
for playing Thor.

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:32.130
When it's time to really gear up for his next
MCU adventure, he can pack on as much as 20

00:04:32.130 --> 00:04:37.070
pounds but in between movies, he keeps going
to the gym, albeit at a more low-key level.

00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:40.980
There's no reason for the cast to keep up
their punishing six-day-a-week workout schedule

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:42.620
if they aren't preparing to film.

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:47.710
But continuing some form of consistent exercise
can help them stay healthy and also stay prepared.

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:51.290
By keeping up with workouts, they won't have
as much work to do in order to get back in

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:52.700
fighting shape for the next movie.

00:04:52.700 --> 00:04:59.500
"Look, The other thing about these big genre
movies is that you don’t want to be the

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:00.500
tubby guy."

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:01.500
Nutrition and mobility

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:04.850
Through focusing on year-round fitness, staying
in shape all the time so they'll be ready

00:05:04.850 --> 00:05:09.790
for the next Marvel film, some of the MCU's
stars have developed a life-altering affinity

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:10.980
for healthy living.

00:05:10.980 --> 00:05:15.130
Chris Hemsworth has even launched a health,
fitness, and diet app, which helps subscribers

00:05:15.130 --> 00:05:18.770
set goals and then complete short, focused
workouts to reach them.

00:05:18.770 --> 00:05:22.840
"Mindfulness, training, nutrition, general health and
well being, and thought wouldn't it be cool

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:27.340
if I could bring all those people together into one space and give you guys access to that team."

00:05:27.350 --> 00:05:32.180
Like the rest of us, the MCU cast isn't getting
any younger and a persistent focus on regular

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:36.430
exercise and sensible nutrition is always
a great way to stay in shape, whether you're

00:05:36.430 --> 00:05:40.890
simply staying healthy or gearing up for a
blockbuster movie like Avengers: Endgame.

00:05:40.890 --> 00:05:44.440
To see how more Avengers actors got in shape,
watch this video right here!

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:47.320
Plus, even more Looper videos about Endgame
are coming soon.

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:50.690
Subscribe to our YouTube channel and hit the
bell so you don't miss a single one.

